# Multi-Merchant Invoice Payment System Implementation Plan

This plan details the technical steps to build a scalable multi-merchant invoicing and payment system within the existing Laravel 5.8 admin panel, initially supporting Square and PayPal.

## Goal Description

Build a system where admins can manage payment gateway configurations, merchants, and invoices. It will generate a secure public link for customers to view and pay their invoices, dynamically routing the payment through the appropriate gateway (Square or PayPal) based on the merchant's assigned account.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> We are using the official `square/square` and `paypal/rest-api-sdk-php` SDKs as requested. Database tables will be created manually via SQL queries instead of Laravel Migrations.

